{
  "title": "在生命周期中使用团队/角色",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <div class=\"WordSection1\">\n    <h1>在生命周期中使用团队/角色（仅限管理员）</h1>\n    <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">系统支持在生命周期转换上指定团队身份组/角色，以控制执行晋升的权限。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>例如，如果在某个特定条目的生命周期转换上指定了\"团队\"身份组，则该团队的任何成员都有权沿该转换从当前状态执行晋升到目标状态。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>类似地，如果在某个特定条目的生命周期转换上指定了\"团队角色\"（如\"团队经理\"），则团队中拥有该角色的任何成员都有权沿该转换从当前状态执行晋升到目标状态。</span></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Note\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <p class=\"Note\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal; font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-style: normal;\">请注意，必须为生命周期所适用的每个条目实例的 '</span><span class=\"SpellE\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-style: normal;\">team_id</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-style: normal;\">' 属性设置团队条目。</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-spacerun: yes; font-style: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-style: normal;\">这为系统在生命周期中进行状态转换权限判定提供了必要的团队信息。</span></i></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <p class=\"Procedure_Title\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><u style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">操作步骤：</span></u></b></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol class=\"Decimal\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 9pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">在现有生命周期映射中查看某个转换（编辑模式），点击生命周期映射表单上部</span> <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-no-proof: yes;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">角色</i></b></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">字段旁的</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-no-proof: yes;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"13\" src=\"/aras-images/image504.jpg\" v:shapes=\"Picture_x0020_6\" width=\"17\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>按钮。系统将打开一个搜索对话框，其中列出了系统中现有的身份组。</span><br>\n        <br>\n        <img src=\"/aras-images/transition.jpg\"><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\"></span></li>\n    </ol>\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol class=\"Decimal\" start=\"2\">\n      <li class=\"Figure_indented\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">使用蓝色搜索栏，筛选 <span class=\"GramE\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Is</i></b></span> <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Alias='0'</i></b> 且 <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Classification='Team'</i></b> 的身份组。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>这将返回可用的系统团队\"角色\"身份组，可直接用于活动分配。</span>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n    \n    <img height=\"328\" src=\"/aras-images/selectID2.jpg\" width=\"735\">\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n                                         list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol class=\"Decimal\" start=\"3\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 4.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">从搜索对话框中选择一个身份组，然后点击 <img src=\"/aras-images/OK.jpg\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">。</span>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?--> <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">系统将把所选的团队身份组填充到生命周期映射表单的角色字段中。</span></li>\n    </ol>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <p class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/lifecycleid.jpg\"></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  </div>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "using_teams_in_life_cycles.htm"
}